{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34154","headline":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 鹤屏 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美公斋四咏次韵 鹤屏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时人重花屏，独即胎化状。\n丛毛练分彩，疎节筇相望。\n曾无氃氋态，颇得连轩样。\n势拟抢高寻，身犹在函丈。\n如忧鸡鹜鬬，似忆烟霞向。\n尘世任纵横，霜襟自闲放。\n空资明远思，不待浮丘相。\n何由振玉衣，一举栖瀛阆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}